@host = https://localhost:7044
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TOKEN_DO_NOT_COMMIT

### Get IDs for categoryId and brandId before creating a product.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/products/lookups
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Includes hidden products.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Example only: replace categoryId/brandId with values from lookups.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Áo thun thực hành [synthetic]",
  "description": "synthetic: Sản phẩm thực hành API admin",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "brandId": 1,
  "isActive": false
}

### Replace productId with the ID returned by POST before sending these requests.
@productId = 0
GET {{host}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Add a variant to the new product.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SYN-PRACTICE-BLACK-M",
  "size": "M",
  "color": "Đen",
  "price": 250000,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "isActive": true
}

### To update: PUT /api/admin/products/{productId} with all product fields.
### To update a variant: PUT /api/admin/products/{productId}/variants/{variantId}
### Include all variant fields plus rowVersion from the latest admin detail response.
### rowVersion is a Base64 string. Reload after HTTP 409 rather than overwriting blindly.
